 ### UI (In-game)
 
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5531+) **Beautified** and **expanded**, and add **support for text upscaling** for miscallenous **screens**: [CvDawnOfMan.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDawnOfMan.py) ("The sun rises on the Year" greeting new game screen) is **expanded laterally and vertically** to **avoid scrolling**; [CvReplayScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvReplayScreen.py) is **maximized to full screen**; [CvDanQuayle.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDanQuayle.py) ("you have displayed the leadership abilities" post-game screen) is **maximized to full screen** and has a **greatly expanded leader NIF** and **maximized vertically score table** to **avoid scrolling**. See
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5531+) **Beautified** and **expanded**, and add **support for text upscaling** for miscallenous **screens**: [CvDawnOfMan.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDawnOfMan.py) ("The sun rises on the Year" greeting new game screen) is **expanded laterally and vertically** to **avoid scrolling** and add **icons** for buildings and units; [CvReplayScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvReplayScreen.py) is **maximized to full screen**; [CvDanQuayle.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDanQuayle.py) ("you have displayed the leadership abilities" post-game screen) is **maximized to full screen** and has a **greatly expanded leader NIF** and **maximized vertically score table** to **avoid scrolling**. See [README.md (Miscallenous screens)](/README.md#miscallenous-screens)
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5517+) **Reorganized advisors**: **merged** the **espionage** screen into the **Foreign Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Finance Tab** into the **Domestic Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Environment Tab** into the **Info Screen**, the **Religion** Advisor and **Corporation** Advisor (so it is always visible and easier to access) into the new **Policy Advisor**; so they are now **tabs of these instead** (deleted the old now obsolete lone advisor .py files); **swap advisors**: **Victory screen** to F9 and **Info Screen** to F8 so the Info Screen is easier to split to F7 and F8 later on and so layout is **more logically organized** from internal to external advisors; **split advisors**: the **Foreign Advisor** is now split into **Foreign Trade Advisor (F4)** (TREATIES, BONUSES, TECHS, CITIES), and **Foreign Diplomacy Advisor (F3)** (RELATIONS, GLANCE, INFO, ESPIONAGE) as it **was crowded** to reduce the need for **tab navigation** and for **clearer thematic differentiation**, using a shell (i.e. almost empty file for **linking only**) [CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py) file for the 2nd advisor.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5524+) Rearrange Advisor **keyboard shortcuts** (in [CIV4ControlInfos.xml](/Assets/XML/Units/CIV4ControlInfos.xml) and DLL files like [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvGameInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameInterface.cpp), and [CyEnumsInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyEnumsInterface.cpp)) and adjust the **order of advisor buttons** in map view and **Sevopedia shortcuts** corresponding text to match the advisors changes.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5521+) **Expand** and most **advisors** so they scale to **game resolution dynamically** instead of hardcoded advisor screen dimensions. The code was also refactored to improve **dynamic scaling**, ensuring **most UI elements automatically realign** if dimensions are changed. Advisors are now **excentered** so **overall more information** is displayed, thus **reducing the need for scrolling**, while still **preserving key relevant information** for display (scoreboard, map, commerce sliders and values, etc.). Some of their dimensions are **harmonized**. Note: some **right space for scoreboard** and **top space for the top bars** of the main interface was made (since commerce sliders are now as of now on the right side, they don't need left space anymore). See [Main Advisors reworks](/README.md#main-advisors-reworks-eg-score-tab-timeline-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor)

